    "created_at": "2022-04-18T15:40:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-18T15:40:51Z",
    "body": "> There's definitely a pile of \"back button works in Chrome but not Firefox\" bugs out there though,\r\n\r\nI don't think any of those are related to popstate/hashchange ordering, though. Instead I believe most are due to inconsistent mapping of the back button to the joint session history, per https://github.com/WICG/interventions/issues/21.",
